#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:320
msgid "Bridges fan speed"
msgstr "브릿지 팬 속도"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:325
msgid "This fan speed is enforced during all bridges and overhangs."
msgstr "이 팬 속도는 모든 브릿지 및 오버행 중에 적용됩니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:334
msgid "Bridge flow ratio"
msgstr "브릿지 유량(flow)값"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:339
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of plastic for bridging. You can decrease it "
"slightly to pull the extrudates and prevent sagging, although default "
"settings are usually good and you should experiment with cooling (use a fan) "
"before tweaking this."
msgstr ""
"이 요인은 브리징을 위한 플라스틱의 양에 영향을 미칩니다. 압출 성형물을 잡아 "
"당겨 처짐을 방지하기 위해 약간 줄일 수 있지만 기본 설정은 일반적으로 좋지만"
"이 문제를 해결하기 전에 냉각 (팬 사용)을 시도해야합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:350
msgid "Single perimeter on top surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:355
msgid ""
"Use only one perimeter on flat top surface, to give more space to the top "
"infill pattern. Could be applied on topmost surface or all top surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:359
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2485
