msgid "This setting enables dynamic fan speed control on overhangs."
msgstr ""

#. TRN FilamentSettings : "Dynamic fan speeds"
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:490
msgid ""
"Overhang size is expressed as a percentage of overlap of the extrusion with "
"the previous layer: 100% would be full overlap (no overhang), while 0% "
"represents full overhang (floating extrusion, bridge). Fan speeds for "
"overhang sizes in between are calculated via linear interpolation."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:553
msgid "Brim width"
msgstr "브림 폭"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:558
msgid ""
"The horizontal width of the brim that will be printed around each object on "
"the first layer. When raft is used, no brim is generated (use "
"raft_first_layer_expansion)."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:568
msgid "Brim type"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:573
msgid ""
"The places where the brim will be printed around each object on the first "
"layer."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:576
msgid "No brim"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:577
msgid "Outer brim only"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:578
msgid "Inner brim only"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:579
msgid "Outer and inner brim"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:586
msgid "Brim separation gap"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:591
msgid ""
"Offset of brim from the printed object. The offset is applied after the "
"elephant foot compensation."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:642
msgid "Complete individual objects"
msgstr "개별 개체 완성"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:647
msgid ""
"When printing multiple objects or copies, this feature will complete each "
"object before moving onto next one (and starting it from its bottom layer). "
"This feature is useful to avoid the risk of ruined prints. PrusaSlicer "
"should warn and prevent you from extruder collisions, but beware."
msgstr ""
"여러 객체 또는 사본을 인쇄 할 때이 객체는 다음 객체로 이동하기 전에 각 객체"
"를 완성합니다 (맨 아래 레이어에서 시작). 이 기능은 인쇄물이 망가지는 위험을 "
"피할 때 유용합니다. PrusaSlicer은 압출기 충돌을 경고하고 예방해야하지만 조심"
"하십시오."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:656
msgid "Enable auto cooling"
msgstr "자동 냉각 사용"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:662
msgid ""
"This flag enables the automatic cooling logic that adjusts print speed and "
"fan speed according to layer printing time."
msgstr ""
"이 플래그는 레이어 인쇄 시간에 따라 인쇄 속도와 팬 속도를 조정하는 자동 냉각 "
"논리를 활성화합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:669
msgid "Cooling slowdown logic"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:675
msgid ""
"Determines how the printer slows down layer printing when the minimum layer "
"time isn't reached. 'Consistent surface' first tries to preserve the print "
"speeds of the first two perimeters by slowing all other features. Only if "
"this isn't sufficient, it also slows down those first two perimeters. "
"'Uniform cooling' slows down all print features, including the first two "
"perimeters."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:685
msgid "Uniform cooling"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:688
msgid "Consistent surface"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:695
msgid "Perimeter transition distance"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:701
msgid ""
"Distance in millimeters before non-slowed perimeters where the original "
"unslowed print speed is restored. This reduces print quality issues when "
"transitioning from heavily slowed feature to fast perimeter printing."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:710
msgid "Cooling tube position"
msgstr "냉각 튜브 위치"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:714
msgid "Distance of the center-point of the cooling tube from the extruder tip."
msgstr "압출기 끝에서 냉각 튜브의 중심점의 거리."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:721
msgid "Cooling tube length"
msgstr "냉각 튜브 길이"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:725
msgid "Length of the cooling tube to limit space for cooling moves inside it."
msgstr "냉각 튜브의 길이는 냉각을위한 공간을 제한하는 내부 이동합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:737
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:4298
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:544
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:1045
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Config/ConfigItemExtruderSelection.cpp:105
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/PrintHost/PrintHostRepetier.cpp:71
msgid "Default"
msgstr "기본값"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:738
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will be reset to after the role-"
"specific acceleration values are used (perimeter/infill). Set zero to "
"prevent resetting acceleration at all."
msgstr ""
"역할 별 가속도 값이 사용 된 후에 프린터가 재설정되는 속도입니다 (둘레 / 충"
"전). 가속을 전혀 재설정하지 않으려면 0으로 설정하십시오."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:763
msgid "Disable fan for the first"
msgstr "첫 번째 팬 사용 중지"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:768
msgid ""
"You can set this to a positive value to disable fan at all during the first "
"layers, so that it does not make adhesion worse."
msgstr ""
"이 값을 양수 값으로 설정하면 첫 번째 레이어에서 팬을 사용하지 않도록 설정하"
"여 접착력을 악화시키지 않습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:770
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2204
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:3219
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:3634
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:3739
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:4089
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:4189
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:4210
msgid "layers"
msgstr "레이어"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:779
msgid "Don't support bridges"
msgstr "서포트와 브릿지를 사용하지 않음"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:784
msgid ""
"Experimental option for preventing support material from being generated "
"under bridged areas."
msgstr ""
"브릿지 영역 아래에 서포팅 재료가 생성되는 것을 방지하기위한 실험적 옵션."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:804
msgid ""
"This end procedure is inserted at the end of the output file. Note that you "
"can use placeholder variables for all PrusaSlicer settings."
msgstr ""
"이 최종 절차는 출력 파일의 끝에 삽입됩니다. 모든 PrusaSlicer 설정에 자리 표시"
"자 변수를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:825
msgid ""
"This end procedure is inserted at the end of the output file, before the "
"printer end gcode (and before any toolchange from this filament in case of "
"multimaterial printers). Note that you can use placeholder variables for all "
"PrusaSlicer settings. If you have multiple extruders, the gcode is processed "
"in extruder order."
msgstr ""
"이 최종 절차는 프린터가 gcode를 종료하기 전에 출력 파일의 끝에 삽입됩니다(다"
"중 재료 프린터의 경우 이 필라멘트에서 도구 변경 하기 전에). 모든 PrusaSlicer "
"설정에 자리 표시자 변수를 사용할 수 있습니다. 압출기가 여러 개 있는 경우 "
"gcode는 압출기 순서로 처리됩니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:837
msgid "Ensure vertical shell thickness"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:842
msgid ""
"Add solid infill near sloping surfaces to guarantee the vertical shell "
"thickness (top+bottom solid layers)."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:847
msgid "Partial"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:848
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:3106
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:3653
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:854
msgid "Top fill pattern"
msgstr "상단 채우기 패턴"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:859
msgid ""
"Fill pattern for top infill. This only affects the top visible layer, and "
"not its adjacent solid shells."
msgstr ""
"상단 채우기패턴으로 채우기. 이는 인접한 솔리드 쉘이 아닌 맨 위 가시 레이어에"
"만 영향을 줍니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:865
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:888
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1667
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:4279
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:4299
msgid "Rectilinear"
msgstr "직선면(Rectilinear)"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:866
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:889
msgid "Monotonic"
msgstr "단조"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:867
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:890
msgid "Monotonic lines"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:868
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:891
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1668
msgid "Aligned rectilinear"
msgstr "정렬된 직선성"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:869
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:892
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1674
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:4300
msgid "Concentric"
msgstr "동심원(Concentric)"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:870
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:893
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1678
msgid "Hilbert curve"
msgstr "힐버트 곡선(Hilbert Curve)"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:871
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:894
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1679
msgid "Archimedean chords"
msgstr "아르키메데우스(Archimedean Chords)"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:872
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:895
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1680
msgid "Octagram spiral"
msgstr "옥타그램 나선(Octagram Spiral)"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:878
msgid "Bottom fill pattern"
msgstr "하단 채우기 패턴"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:883
msgid ""
"Fill pattern for bottom infill. This only affects the bottom external "
"visible layer, and not its adjacent solid shells."
msgstr ""
"하단 채우기 패턴에 대한 채우기 패턴입니다. 이는 인접한 솔리드 쉘이 아닌 하단 "
"외부 가시 레이어에만 영향을 줍니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:901
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:918
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:3002
msgid "External perimeters"
msgstr "외측 둘레"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:906
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for external "
"perimeters. If left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, "
"otherwise 1.125 x nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage "
"(for example 200%), it will be computed over nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:923
msgid ""
"This separate setting will affect the speed of external perimeters (the "
"visible ones). If expressed as percentage (for example: 80%) it will be "
"calculated on the perimeters speed setting above. Set to zero for auto."
msgstr ""
"이 별도의 설정은 외부 경계선(시각적 경계선)의 속도에 영향을 미친다. 백분율"
"(예: 80%)로 표현되는 경우 위의 Perimeter 속도 설정에 따라 계산된다. 자동을 위"
"해 0으로 설정한다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:934
msgid "External perimeters first"
msgstr "외부 경계선 먼저"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:939
msgid ""
"Print contour perimeters from the outermost one to the innermost one instead "
"of the default inverse order."
msgstr "기본 역순 대신 가장 바깥쪽부터 가장 안쪽까지 윤곽선을 인쇄합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:946
msgid "Extra perimeters if needed"
msgstr "필요한 경우 추가 둘레"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:951
msgid ""
"Add more perimeters when needed for avoiding gaps in sloping walls. "
"PrusaSlicer keeps adding perimeters, until more than 70% of the loop "
"immediately above is supported."
msgstr ""
"경사 벽의 틈을 피하기 위해 필요한 경우 더 많은 둘래(perimeter)를 추가하십시"
"오. 위의 루프의 70% of 이상이 지지될 때까지 PrusaSlicer는 계속해서 둘ㄹ를 추"
"가한다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:959
msgid "Extra perimeters on overhangs (experimental)"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:964
msgid ""
"Detect overhang areas where bridges cannot be anchored, and fill them with "
"extra perimeter paths. These paths are anchored to the nearby non-overhang "
"area when possible."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:971
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/FdmViewerWrapper.cpp:873
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:165
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:182
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:200
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:212
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:233
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:648
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:683
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:742
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:771
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:788
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Legend.cpp:809
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/PrintSettingsDialog.cpp:143
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/SidebarObject.cpp:295
#: src/slic3r-shared-wx/src/Slic3r/App/WX/BitmapGetters.cpp:131
msgid "Extruder"
msgstr "익스트루더"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:974
msgid ""
"The extruder to use (unless more specific extruder settings are specified). "
"This value overrides perimeter and infill extruders, but not the support "
"extruders."
msgstr ""
"사용할 익스트루더(더 구체적인 익스트루더 설정이 지정되지 않은 경우) 이 값은 "
"파라미터 및 익스트루더를 초과하지만, 서포트 익스트루더는 초과 하지 않는다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:991
msgid "Extruder offset"
msgstr "익스트루더 오프셋"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:992
msgid ""
"If your firmware doesn't handle the extruder displacement you need the G-"
"code to take it into account. This option lets you specify the displacement "
"of each extruder with respect to the first one. It expects positive "
"coordinates (they will be subtracted from the XY coordinate)."
msgstr ""
"펌웨어가 익스트루더 위치 변경을 처리하지 못하면 G 코드를 고려해야합니다. 이 "
"옵션을 사용하면 첫 번째 것에 대한 각 압출기의 변위를 지정할 수 있습니다. 양"
"의 좌표가 필요합니다 (XY 좌표에서 뺍니다)."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1013
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Plater/SvgDialog.cpp:173
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Plater/TextDialog.cpp:87
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/FdmViewerWrapper.cpp:909
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/FdmViewerWrapper.cpp:1119
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Types.cpp:91
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/Types.cpp:94
msgid "Height"
msgstr "높이"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1014
msgid ""
"Only used when 'Print settings -> Complete individual objects' is active. "
"Set this to the vertical distance between your nozzle tip and (usually) the "
"X carriage rods. Used to check for collisions with previously printed "
"objects and to prevent them when arranging.\n"
"The value is ignored for most Prusa printers, which come with more detailed "
"extruder model."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1028
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "반경"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1029
msgid ""
"Only used when 'Print settings -> Complete individual objects' is active. "
"Set this to a radius of a nozzle-centered cylinder big enough to enclose the "
"extruder assembly. Used to check for collisions with previously printed "
"objects and to prevent them when arranging.\n"
"The value is ignored for most Prusa printers, which come with more detailed "
"extruder model."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1040
msgid "Extrusion multiplier"
msgstr "압출 승수"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1045
msgid ""
"This factor changes the amount of flow proportionally. You may need to tweak "
"this setting to get nice surface finish and correct single wall widths. "
"Usual values are between 0.9 and 1.1. If you think you need to change this "
"more, check filament diameter and your firmware E steps."
msgstr ""
"이 요소는 비례하여 유량의 양을 변경합니다. 멋진 서페이스 마무리와 단일 벽 너"
"비를 얻기 위해이 설정을 조정해야 할 수도 있습니다. 일반적인 값은 0.9와 1.1 사"
"이입니다. 이 값을 더 변경해야한다고 판단되면 필라멘트 직경과 펌웨어 E 단계를 "
"확인하십시오."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1055
msgid "Default extrusion width"
msgstr "기본 압출 폭"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1060
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to allow a manual extrusion width. If left to "
"zero, PrusaSlicer derives extrusion widths from the nozzle diameter (see the "
"tooltips for perimeter extrusion width, infill extrusion width etc). If "
"expressed as percentage (for example: 230%), it will be computed over nozzle "
"diameter."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1074
msgid "Keep fan always on"
msgstr "항상 팬 켜기"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1079
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, fan will never be disabled and will be kept running at "
"least at its minimum speed. Useful for PLA, harmful for ABS."
msgstr ""
"이 기능을 사용하면 팬이 비활성화되지 않으며 최소한 최소 속도로 계속 회전합니"
"다. PLA에 유용하며 ABS에 해롭다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1086
msgid "Enable fan if layer print time is below"
msgstr "레이어 인쇄 시간이 미만인 경우 팬 활성화"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1091
msgid ""
"If layer print time is estimated below this number of seconds, fan will be "
"enabled and its speed will be calculated by interpolating the minimum and "
"maximum speeds."
msgstr ""
"레이어 인쇄 시간이, 초 미만으로 예상되는 경우 팬이 활성화되고 속도는 최소 및 "
"최대 속도를 보간하여 계산됩니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1093
msgid "approximate seconds"
msgstr "근사치 초"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1100
msgid "Filament change time"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1104
msgid ""
"Time required for a single filament change. On a printer with multiple tools "
"this is the time required for a single toolchange to take place. On a "
"printer with multi-material upgrade, this is the time required to unload and "
"load a new filament."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1110
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1250
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1382
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:3681
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:137
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:149
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:161
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:379
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:390
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:401
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:412
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:423
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:434
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:830
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:842
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:970
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:993
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:1017
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:1040
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:49
#: src/slic3r-shared-wx/src/Slic3r/App/WX/RammingChart.cpp:130
#: src/slic3r-shared-wx/src/Slic3r/App/WX/RammingDialog.cpp:166
msgid "s"
msgstr "s"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1116
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:274
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Preview/FdmViewerWrapper.cpp:1157
msgid "Color"
msgstr "색상"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1124
msgid ""
"Leave unused if the filament profile isn't tied to a specific color. Color "
"can still be set at project-level."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1131
msgid "Filament notes"
msgstr "필라멘트 메모"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1136
msgid "You can put your notes regarding the filament here."
msgstr "여기에 필라멘트에 관한 메모를 넣을 수 있다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1145
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2798
msgid "Max volumetric speed"
msgstr "최대 체적 속도"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1149
msgid ""
"Maximum volumetric speed allowed for this filament. Limits the maximum "
"volumetric speed of a print to the minimum of print and filament volumetric "
"speed. Set to zero for no limit."
msgstr ""
"이 필라멘트에 허용되는 최대 체적 속도. 인쇄물의 최대 체적 속도를 인쇄 및 필라"
"멘트 체적 속도 최소로 제한한다. 제한 없음에 대해 0으로 설정하십시오."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1152
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1421
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2805
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:46
#: src/slic3r-shared-wx/src/Slic3r/App/WX/RammingChart.cpp:141
msgid "mm³/s"
msgstr "mm³/s²"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1159
msgid "Max non-crossing infill speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1164
msgid ""
"Maximum speed allowed for this filament while printing infill without any "
"self intersections in a single layer. Set to zero for no limit."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1174
msgid "Max crossing infill speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1179
msgid ""
"Maximum speed allowed for this filament while printing infill with self "
"intersections in a single layer. Set to zero for no limit."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1189
msgid "Loading speed"
msgstr "로딩 속도"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1194
msgid "Speed used for loading the filament on the wipe tower."
msgstr "와이퍼 타워(wipe)에 필라멘트를 장착하는 데 사용되는 속도. "

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1202
msgid "Loading speed at the start"
msgstr "시작시 로딩 속도"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1207
msgid "Speed used at the very beginning of loading phase."
msgstr "로딩 단계의 시작 부분에 사용되는 속도입니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1215
msgid "Unloading speed"
msgstr "언로딩 스피드"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1220
msgid ""
"Speed used for unloading the filament on the wipe tower (does not affect  "
"initial part of unloading just after ramming)."
msgstr ""
"와이퍼 타워에서 필라멘트를 언로드하는 데 사용되는 속도(램핑 후 바로 언로딩의 "
"초기 부분에는 영향을 주지 않음)."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1229
msgid "Unloading speed at the start"
msgstr "시작 시 하역 속도"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1234
msgid ""
"Speed used for unloading the tip of the filament immediately after ramming."
msgstr "충돌 직후 필라멘트의 끝을 언로드하는 데 사용되는 속도입니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1242
msgid "Delay after unloading"
msgstr "언로드 후 딜레이"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1247
msgid ""
"Time to wait after the filament is unloaded. May help to get reliable "
"toolchanges with flexible materials that may need more time to shrink to "
"original dimensions."
msgstr ""
"필라멘트를 내린 후 기다리는 시간. 원래 치수로 축소하는 데, 더 많은 시간이 필"
"요할 수 있는 유연한 재료로 신뢰할 수있는 공구 교환을 얻을 수 있습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1257
msgid "Stamping loading speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1262
msgid "Speed used for stamping."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1270
msgid "Stamping distance measured from the center of the cooling tube"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1275
msgid ""
"If set to nonzero value, filament is moved toward the nozzle between the "
"individual cooling moves (\"stamping\"). This option configures how long "
"this movement should be before the filament is retracted again."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1284
msgid "Number of cooling moves"
msgstr "쿨링 이동 숫자"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1289
msgid ""
"Filament is cooled by being moved back and forth in the cooling tubes. "
"Specify desired number of these moves."
msgstr ""
"필라멘트는 냉각 튜브에서 앞뒤로 이동하여 냉각됩니다. 이러한 이동의 원하는 수"
"를 지정합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1298
msgid "Speed of the first cooling move"
msgstr "첫 번째 냉각 이동 속도"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1303
msgid "Cooling moves are gradually accelerating beginning at this speed."
msgstr "냉각 속도가 서서히 빨라지고 있습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1311
msgid "Minimal purge on wipe tower"
msgstr "와이프(wipe) 탑의 최소 퍼지"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1316
msgid ""
"After a tool change, the exact position of the newly loaded filament inside "
"the nozzle may not be known, and the filament pressure is likely not yet "
"stable. Before purging the print head into an infill or a sacrificial "
"object, PrusaSlicer will always prime this amount of material into the wipe "
"tower to produce successive infill or sacrificial object extrusions reliably."
msgstr ""
"공구가 변경 된 후 노즐 내부에 새로 로드 된 필라멘트의 정확한 위치를 알 수 없"
"으며, 필라멘트 압력이 아직 안정적이지 않을 수 있습니다. 프린트 헤드를 인필 또"
"는 희생(sacrificial) 객체로 소거 하기 전에 PrusaSlicer는 항상이 양의 재료를 "
"와이프 탑에 넣어 연속적인 채우기 또는 희생(sacrificial) 객체 돌출을 안정적으"
"로 생성 합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1320
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1408
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1436
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2983
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:45
msgid "mm³"
msgstr "mm"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1327
msgid "Speed of the last cooling move"
msgstr "마지막 냉각 이동 속도"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1332
msgid "Cooling moves are gradually accelerating towards this speed."
msgstr "냉각 이동은 이 속도로 점차 가속화되고 있습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1340
msgid "Purge volume multiplier"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1345
msgid ""
"Purging volume on the wipe tower is determined by 'multimaterial_purging' in "
"Printer settings. This option allows to modify the volume on filament level. "
"Note that the project can override this by setting project-specific values."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1355
msgid "Ramming parameters"
msgstr "래밍 파라미터"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1360
msgid ""
"This string is edited by RammingDialog and contains ramming specific "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"이 문자열은 RammingDialog에 의해 편집되고 래밍 특정 매개 변수를 포함합니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1367
msgid "Ramming temperature variation"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1371
msgid ""
"Temperature difference to be applied right before ramming. The value can be "
"negative."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1378
msgid "Pause before ramming"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1383
msgid ""
"Time in seconds that the printer will remain idle before ramming, allowing "
"the melt zone temperature to equalize."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1389
msgid "Enable ramming for multitool setups"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1394
msgid ""
"Perform ramming when using multitool printer (i.e. when the 'Single extruder "
"multimaterial' in Printer settings is unchecked). When checked, a small "
"amount of filament is rapidly extruded on the wipe tower just before the "
"toolchange. This option is only used when the wipe tower is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1402
msgid "Multitool ramming volume"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1407
msgid "The volume to be rammed before the toolchange."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1415
msgid "Multitool ramming flow"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1420
msgid "Flow used for ramming the filament before the toolchange."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1428
msgid "Flush volume"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1434
msgid ""
"Volume of filament to flush during a tool change. Used in custom toolchange "
"G-code."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1443
msgid "Flush speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1449
msgid ""
"Extrusion speed used for flushing during a tool change. Used in custom "
"toolchange G-code."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1458
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Plater/MeasureDialog.cpp:156
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Config/BedShape.cpp:53
msgid "Diameter"
msgstr "필라멘트 직경"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1463
msgid ""
"Enter your filament diameter here. Good precision is required, so use a "
"caliper and do multiple measurements along the filament, then compute the "
"average."
msgstr ""
"여기에 필라멘트 직경을 입력하십시오. 정밀도가 필요하므로 캘리퍼를 사용하여 필"
"라멘트를 따라 여러 번 측정 한 다음 평균을 계산하십시오."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1472
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:340
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:344
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/Plater/SlaSupportPointsDialog.cpp:47
msgid "Density"
msgstr "밀도"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1477
msgid ""
"Enter your filament density here. This is only for statistical information. "
"A decent way is to weigh a known length of filament and compute the ratio of "
"the length to volume. Better is to calculate the volume directly through "
"displacement."
msgstr ""
"여기서 필라멘트 밀도를 입력하십시오. 이것은 통계 정보 용입니다. 괜찮은 방법"
"은 알려진 길이의 필라멘트의 무게를 측정하고 길이와 볼륨의 비율을 계산하는 것"
"입니다. 변위를 통해 직접적으로 부피를 계산하는 것이 더 좋습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1480
msgid "g/cm³"
msgstr "g/cm³"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1487
msgid "Filament type"
msgstr "필라멘트 타입"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1492
msgid "The filament material type for use in custom G-codes."
msgstr "사용자 지정 G 코드에 사용할 필라멘트 재료 유형입니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1520
msgid "Soluble material"
msgstr "수용성 재료"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1525
msgid "Soluble material is most likely used for a soluble support."
msgstr "수용성 재료눈 물에 녹는 서포트에 가장 많이 사용된다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1531
msgid "Abrasive material"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1536
msgid ""
"This flag means that the material is abrasive and requires a hardened "
"nozzle. The value is used by the printer to check it."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1541
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:351
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsSLA.cpp:355
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/App/ObjectListWindow.cpp:107
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "비용"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1546
msgid ""
"Enter your filament cost per kg here. This is only for statistical "
"information."
msgstr "필라멘트(kg당) 비용을 여기에 입력하십시오. 통계를 내기 위해서 입니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1547
msgid "money/kg"
msgstr "원(\\)/kg"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1554
msgid "Spool weight"
msgstr "스풀 중량"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1559
msgid ""
"Enter weight of the empty filament spool. One may weigh a partially consumed "
"filament spool before printing and one may compare the measured weight with "
"the calculated weight of the filament with the spool to find out whether the "
"amount of filament on the spool is sufficient to finish the print."
msgstr ""
"빈 필라멘트 스풀의 무게를 입력합니다. 하나는 인쇄하기 전에 부분적으로 소비 필"
"라멘트 스풀을 무게 수 있으며, 하나는 스풀에 필라멘트의 양이 인쇄를 완료하기"
"에 충분한지 여부를 확인하기 위해 스풀과 필라멘트의 계산 된 무게와 측정 된 무"
"게를 비교할 수 있습니다."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:1563
#: src/slic3r-shared/src/Slic3r/Biz/Units.cpp:34
msgid "g"
